From: yym <183073514+yym108@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:36:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/28] arm64: dts: qcom: add Xiaomi Pad 7 Pro (muyu) DT and
 built-in DTB boot support

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |    1 +
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm8635-xiaomi-muyu.dts      | 2824 +++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/kernel/setup.c                     |   35 +-
